    "sectionHeadings": [
      "065: Init and the kit are one adoption",
      "1. Purpose",
      "2. Territory",
      "3. Behavior",
      "3.1 Plain `init` writes an `AGENTS.md`",
      "3.2 `init --with-kit`",
      "3.3 It refuses to clobber",
      "3.4 The scaffolded repository is immediately governed",
